'''Chroma Mortal''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is current obtainable by purchasing the Mortal Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or the [[Mortal Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2026|2026 Halloween Event]].

== Appearance ==
It uses the same mesh as [[Mortal]], however, the bright orange parts have been altered to alternate colors.

== Trivia ==

* It pairs with the godly gun [[Chroma Immortal]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Mortal Set|Chroma Mortal Set]].
* It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Mortal]].
